grh-ch4-body : List Word
grh-ch4-body =
  grh-ln "  <p>In Hyperactivity&#x27;s guard algebra (<code>lib/ir/hx-base-flash-miner.hypercubical</code> &amp; Section 2 of <code>lib/math/grh-atlas.hypercubical</code>), <strong>superoptimization and counterexample synthesis are dual faces of one total function</strong> over defect guards <code>eBad : GaGuard</code>:</p>" (
  grh-ln "  <div class='thm-box'>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='thm-head'><span>Theorem (Superopt &equiv; Hypercrack Duality)</span><span>ga-thm-superopt-empty-fiber &middot; 0 Postulates</span></div>" (
  grh-ln "    <ul style='margin-bottom:0'>" (
  grh-ln "      <li><strong>Superopt (<code>ga-superopt n eBad &equiv; ga-k false</code>):</strong> Soundness of boolean-ite-complement factoring (<code>ga-thm-superopt-sound</code>) transports <code>ga-k false</code> across every valuation <code>env : Nat &rarr; Bool</code>, producing a closed constructive proof of <code>((env : Nat &rarr; Bool) &times; (ga-eval env eBad &equiv; true)) &rarr; Empty</code>.</li>" (
  grh-ln "      <li><strong>Hypercrack (<code>ga-hypercrack eBad &equiv; inr mask</code>):</strong> Whenever a formalization leaves an unclosed analytical obligation, <code>ga-superopt</code> leaves a non-false residual cone and <code>ga-hypercrack</code> deterministically synthesizes the minimal bitmask counterexample <code>mask : Word</code> satisfying <code>ga-eval (ga-env4 mask) eBad &equiv; true</code>.</li>" (
  grh-ln "    </ul>" (
  grh-ln "  </div>" (
  grh-ln "  <p>Checking <code>ga-thm-hypercrack-masullo-closure = refl</code> establishes three machine-checked results simultaneously: (1) Alp&ouml;ge&#x27;s putative off-line zero guard (<span class='m'>&Re;(&rho;) &gt; 1/2</span> requiring simultaneous Landau violation <code>&not;one_sided_bound</code> and <code>star_inequality</code> pole shift <code>one_sided_bound</code>) collapses to <code>ga-k false</code> &rarr; <code>Empty</code> fiber; (2) Masullo&#x27;s raw Layer-5 trace without regularizers is cracked immediately at minimal witness <code>mask = #0</code>; and (3) transporting Alp&ouml;ge&#x27;s 4 proved local regularizers (<code>IsPolar</code>, <code>CutTailBound</code>, <code>GlobalSieve</code>, <code>EqualMultiplicities</code>) across <code>ga-adelic-seesaw-knot : GnKnot AlpoLocalCoord MasulloLayer5Coord</code> collapses Masullo&#x27;s defect guard to <code>ga-k false</code> &rarr; <code>Empty</code> fiber.</p>" (
  grh-ln "  <div class='lab-card' id='labCrack'>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='lab-head'>" (
  grh-ln "      <span class='lbl'>Lab 3 &middot; Live Superopt &equiv; Hypercrack Defect Cracker &amp; GnKnot Regularizer Closure</span>" (
  grh-ln "      <span class='lab-status' id='ckStatus'>PROVED &middot; Defect Fiber &equiv; Empty (inl unit)</span>" (
  grh-ln "    </div>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='lab-ctrl'>" (
  grh-ln "      <span>Target Guard:</span>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn on' data-cm='masullo' type='button'>Masullo Layer-5 + GnKnot Regularizers</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn' data-cm='alpo' type='button'>Alp&ouml;ge Off-Line Zero (&Re;(&rho;) &gt; 1/2)</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn blue' id='ckBreakAll' type='button'>Strip All 4 Regularizers (Raw Layer-5)</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn blue' id='ckLockAll' type='button'>Transport All 4 Regularizers (GnKnot)</button>" (
  grh-ln "    </div>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='key-grid' id='ckKeys'>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='key-tgl on' data-ki='0' type='button'><span>[Reg 0] alc-is-polar &rarr; Meyer Mellin (Ch05:3689)</span><b>ON</b></button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='key-tgl on' data-ki='1' type='button'><span>[Reg 1] alc-bessel-cut-tail &rarr; Cluster Trace (Ch10:8554)</span><b>ON</b></button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='key-tgl on' data-ki='2' type='button'><span>[Reg 2] alc-global-kloosterman &rarr; Off-S Shells (I395/M50)</span><b>ON</b></button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='key-tgl on' data-ki='3' type='button'><span>[Reg 3] alc-labesse-trace-eq &rarr; Global=S-Local (M25)</span><b>ON</b></button>" (
  grh-ln "    </div>" (
  grh-ln "    <pre id='ckOut' style='margin:0;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)'></pre>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='lab-metrics' id='ckMetrics'></div>" (
  grh-ln "  </div>" nil)))))))))))))))))))))))))))))
